{"data": {"node": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "5477835475651321", "organization": {"id": "185246380991168", "viewer_permissions": [], "application_groupings": {"nodes": [{"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "5477835475651321"}]}, "id": "126596813726299"}]}}, "firstRevision": {"nodes": [{"application": {"id": "5477835475651321", "release_date": 1728582540, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "scheduled_offers": {"count": 16}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "27682631294745088"}, "id": "2493148167513843"}]}}, "binary": null, "live_binary": null, "created_date": 1792006717, "id": "27844152115259671", "is_initial_release": false, "name_with_fallback": "v13", "pdp_metadata_with_fallback": {"version": 12, "application": {"is_concept": false, "latest_released_pdp_metadata": {"id": "27989442490730632"}, "release_status": "RELEASED", "id": "5477835475651321"}, "id": "27989442490730632", "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "release_date": null, "administration_status": "APPROVED", "is_first": false, "release_status": "RELEASED", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "5477835475651321", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "6451204481610809"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2529841570821610", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "DodgeALL", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**DodgeALL** es un intenso juego de RV que pone a prueba tu agilidad y tus reflejos. \u00a1La \u00fanica regla: esquivar todo! Sus mundos 3D inmersivos y su jugabilidad basada en f\u00edsicas ofrecen retos nuevos y diversi\u00f3n sin fin. Esquiva, ag\u00e1chate, l\u00e1nzate al suelo y gatea: tu habilidad, velocidad y resistencia deciden si sobrevives.\n\n# \u00bfEst\u00e1s listo para DodgeALL?\n\n# Caracter\u00edsticas:\n- Realidad mixta: Disponible en una nueva campa\u00f1a y en el Modo Fiesta.\n- Modo Fiesta: Juega contra amigos y familiares con m\u00f3viles y tabletas Android/iOS. Ayuda, fastidia o haz ambas cosas. Para unirse, basta con descargar gratis \"DodgeALL Party\" de la tienda de apps.\n- Escala de habitaci\u00f3n y 360\u00b0: Mu\u00e9vete en el juego como en tu habitaci\u00f3n. Sin movimiento artificial: **\u00a1Aqu\u00ed no hay mareos de RV!**\n- Audio espacial 3D: Oye de d\u00f3nde vienen los obst\u00e1culos.\n- Habilidades: Desbloquea 5 habilidades para cuando la cosa se complique.\n- Modo Infinito: Juega cualquier nivel desbloqueado hasta caer rendido. Cada ronda es m\u00e1s r\u00e1pida.\n- Clasificaciones: Compara tu destreza con la de otros jugadores.\n- Modo interactivo de Twitch: \u00a1Deja que tus espectadores te lancen cosas!\n- Niveles extra: Nuevos retos disparatados publicados regularmente.\n- Niveles personalizados: Crea tus propios niveles (requiere SideQuest).\n\n\u00danete a Discord para preguntar, informar de errores, dar tu opini\u00f3n o proponer nuevos niveles extra:\nhttps://dodgeall.com/discord", "short_description": "\u00a1\u00a1ESQUIVA TODO!!1\n\nEsquiva, ag\u00e1chate, l\u00e1nzate al suelo y gatea entre obst\u00e1culos que te atacan sin parar desde todas direcciones.\n\n\u00a1Ahora con realidad mixta!\n- Nueva campa\u00f1a de ciencia ficci\u00f3n en realidad mixta\n- Modo Fiesta en realidad mixta\n\n\u00a1Ahora con multijugador local!\n- En el Modo Fiesta, tus amigos pueden interactuar contigo desde m\u00f3viles y tabletas iOS/Android con una app gratuita y f\u00e1cil de usar."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2323986291755305", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "DodgeALL", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**DodgeALL** met ton agilit\u00e9 et tes r\u00e9flexes \u00e0 rude \u00e9preuve en VR. Une seule r\u00e8gle : tout esquiver ! D\u00e9cors 3D immersifs, gameplay bas\u00e9 sur la physique et d\u00e9fis vari\u00e9s : rejoue sans fin. Esquive, baisse-toi, plonge et rampe dans un d\u00e9luge d\u2019adr\u00e9naline. Ton adresse, ta vitesse et ton endurance d\u00e9cident de ta survie.\n\n# Pr\u00eat pour DodgeALL ?\n\n# Au programme :\n- R\u00e9alit\u00e9 mixte : Une nouvelle campagne et le mode Party.\n- Mode Party : Affronte tes proches sur smartphones et tablettes Android/iOS. Aide, joue des mauvais tours ou fais les deux ! Pour participer, t\u00e9l\u00e9charge simplement l\u2019appli gratuite \"DodgeALL Party\" sur la boutique d\u2019apps.\n- Roomscale et 360\u00b0 : Bouge dans le jeu comme dans ta pi\u00e8ce. Aucun d\u00e9placement artificiel : **pas de naus\u00e9es en VR !**\n- Audio spatial 3D : Entends d\u2019o\u00f9 arrivent les obstacles.\n- Capacit\u00e9s : 5 capacit\u00e9s \u00e0 d\u00e9bloquer pour les moments difficiles.\n- Mode Infini : Joue \u00e0 tout niveau d\u00e9bloqu\u00e9 jusqu\u2019\u00e0 \u00e9puisement. Chaque manche acc\u00e9l\u00e8re.\n- Classements : Compare tes talents d\u2019esquive \u00e0 ceux des autres.\n- Mode interactif Twitch : Laisse tes spectateurs te lancer des objets !\n- Niveaux bonus : De nouveaux d\u00e9fis d\u00e9jant\u00e9s r\u00e9guli\u00e8rement.\n- Niveaux personnalis\u00e9s : Cr\u00e9e tes propres niveaux (SideQuest requis).\n\nRejoins Discord pour poser tes questions, signaler des bugs, donner ton avis ou me proposer des id\u00e9es de niveaux bonus :\nhttps://dodgeall.com/discord", "short_description": "ESQUIVE TOUT CE QUI BOUGE !!1\n\nEsquive, baisse-toi, plonge et rampe pour survivre \u00e0 une avalanche d\u2019obstacles venant de toutes les directions.\n\nLa r\u00e9alit\u00e9 mixte d\u00e9barque !\n- Nouvelle campagne de science-fiction en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 mixte\n- Mode Party en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 mixte\n\nLe multijoueur local aussi !\n- En mode Party, tes amis interagissent avec toi depuis leurs smartphones et tablettes iOS/Android gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 une appli gratuite et simple \u00e0 utiliser."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Master comp (cover_art_portrait_1008x1440)_BEHIND_vB-02 copy.png", "id": "8500389750080766", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982638_8500389793414095_6421705007661155071_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=n8C5IbUT08YQ7kNvwF_whqU&_nc_oc=AdppeYVHWJVi14L_jZZJYu-DHAgkgQxtK6CTOhPSnzuNQ1P0ANa0H4tf1sGBLovCwMg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR7ZOhj8OO4AC_Y2OyY3OqZtQ2Hezl6crgdr6B1Be425g&oe=6B032A7B"}, {"file_name": "360Preview_Monoscopic_SciFiArena.png", "id": "2479063655783575", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391728_2479063659116908_634514140217959848_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZQ_hscaOx3AQ7kNvwHljr25&_nc_oc=Adqyst7-qNDcBRqZ3_hLBk2YYwX-CJuv1_nQO-Q5sx7jZL_YKWIVnfLYqYFNpllQEr4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQcMw24REgsPtJcaIGnOWaifCUgu9nVhEfPy-BctU-ZRQ&oe=6B03053F"}, {"file_name": "Master comp (hero_cover)_BEHIND_vB-02 with logo copy.png", "id": "1985396085313047", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982687_1985396088646380_2769598609159350613_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ir3O4mRBlnsQ7kNvwFG-_Y-&_nc_oc=AdqQg9hrTw0iLCrrWz2uevag-NOhZKh6FABzeQrf8G9x-LPHuYaUbP7qPQ68TrHayZs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQD4ZMYLNQ1TcRstLYcds0_Rxg-s_dCfjjaUOzlsBnOSg&oe=6B031A21"}, {"file_name": "Master comp (cover_art_square_1440x1440)_BEHIND_vB-02 copy.png", "id": "946695657322336", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-